Z||000000||84fierotrevor||11-08-2001||04:35 PM||||damn ! i put the word fiero in the search box on a ricer site that lets people post there kills.<BR>and all the fiero ones so far are Ricers saying be carfull when u race a fiero they aint as slow as u think they are !<BR>LMAO ! check this story out.<P>fiero vs mustang 5.0<BR>by mustangfan, 31, male<BR>Topic: Car Racing - Street<P>January 16, 2000<P>hello everyone.i have a mustang 5.0 gt 1990.5 speed.i have hooker headers,hypertech chip,etc well i was going down highway 285,and there was this gold fiero looked like a 86 87 se.so i pulled up next to the fiero and looked over and there was a teenage guy with a grin..im in my 30s so i have been racing for about 12 years.well i get in front of him,and we drive for about 10 miles where i pull off for gas he pulles in behind me and said nice car i said thanks you to.he said you want to run i said shure follow me i know where a good back road is.so we went to the back road and lined up and counted down from 3 2 1 and were off what the hell this fiero go the lead on me.and stayed ahead of me until the quater mile was up.i hate to say i lost the race..i asked what he had is that thing.he told me that it was bored to a 3.1 wild cam high performance pistons valves etc.and it was about 200 hp.i thoght fieros were slow???well to say the least im not a bad sport.hope you all watch those little basterds.hahahaha i know next time to ask what they have in it before i race it.take care everybody <P><BR>Comment on this entry  <BR>Name   E-mail  <BR> <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||JSocha||11-08-2001||04:42 PM||||The High School kids, after school lets out, drag race on the highway right in front of our house for about an hour or so before it gets dark.<P>Some were egging me on to bring out my 87 Fiero and race em as they wanted to see how fast they were.<P>I told them I would, however, I would be racing for "Pink Slips".  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>They haven't egged me on in there request since then, and now I have the '86 GT with the M17 4 speed which is alot quicker off the line then my 5 speed!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||6
